cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MasQ: CZI ROI Mask Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A graphical Python application for mask-based quantitative analysis of
  multichannel fluorescence microscopy images in Carl Zeiss Image (CZI)
  format. MasQ supports region-of-interest selection, background correction,
  automatic and manual thresholding, mask generation, object measurements,
  intensity measurements, preview overlays, and CSV export.
authors:
